<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Application Under Review</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <h2>Hello <%= name %>,</h2>

    <p>Your email has been successfully verified.</p>

    <p>
      Your application to become an
      <strong><%= operatorType %></strong>
      in <strong><%= appName %></strong>
      is now under review by our administration team.
    </p>

    <p>We will contact you by email once a decision has been made.</p>

    <p>
      Please do not submit another application while your current application is
      under review.
    </p>

    <br />

    <p>
      Thank you,<br />
      <strong><%= appName %> Team</strong>
    </p>
  </body>
</html>
